OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner calls for immediate
OL,4,Apause on roadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaigner has called on a council to
OL,7,Fhalt overnight tree and hedgerow
OL,8,Fclearance works for a A320 roadworks
OL,9,Fproject.
OL,11,FWork on Ottershaw Roundabout in the
OL,12,FChertsey area of Surrey began earlier
OL,13,Fthis year but was paused in May over
OL,14,Fconcerns about protecting nearby trees.
OL,16,FBob Oliver, from the Ottershaw
OL,17,FNeighbourhood Forum, requested that
OL,18,FSurrey County Council stop its planned
OL,19,Fworks for Tuesday, claiming it was
OL,20,Fbeing restarted before planning and
OL,21,Fenvironmental issues had been settled.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
