OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner calls for immediate
OL,4,Apause on roadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FNatalie Bramhall from Surrey County
OL,7,FCouncil said the county planning
OL,8,Fauthority "has agreed to works
OL,9,Frestarting in the central and eastern
OL,10,Fareas of the roundabout in line with
OL,11,Fthe existing planning permission".
